<title>USA: Thermo TerraTech acquires Carlan.</title>
<headline>Thermo TerraTech acquires Carlan.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo TerraTech Inc said on Wednesday it completed its acquisition of Carlan Consulting Group Inc, a privately-held provider of transportation and environmental consulting, professional engineering and architectural services, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Carlan, with gross revenues of $6 million for the fiscal year ended December 31 1995, will operate as a division of Killam Associates, a wholly owned subsidiary of Thermo TerraTech and be renamed Carlan Killam Consulting Group Inc.</p>
